<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua Yenebi'li' ya Pauli kwa Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tim</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua Yenebi'li' ya Pauli kwa Timoteo</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Balua yi'no niiandike nenga na Pauli, ntumilwe wa Kilisitu Yesu kwa mabinio ga Nnu'ngu'. Nitumilwe li'nga naabakiye bandu bu'kana na ukoto watulagilwe kwa kumwu'bi'lya Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>Nikuandikya wamwana wangu' waupendilwe Timoteo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Nikulu'bya ngu'ngu', kiya na amani bu'ka kwa Tati' Nnu'ngu' na kwa Kilisitu Yesu Bwana witu ibe nawe.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sukulu na mayi'gi'yo go senga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Ninsukulu Nnu'ngu' nywanintumikia kwo binia ganannoga kati mwabaantumikiye au'ku' bangu'. Kilo na muntwekati nendakuku'mbu'kya mumalu'bo gangu'. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Nigaku'mbu'kya moli gako, na nibile na kilu'lu' so bonagana kai' li'nga niupulaise muno mwoyo wangu'. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Niiku'mbu'kya imani yako ya kakape yayaabile wi'ti' kwa mbuya bako Loisi na mau' bako Eunike. Niu'bi'lya panga kakape na wenga ubile nayo kai'. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Kwa kitumbu si' nganikuku'mbu'ki'a uutili upo ya kiloo yawipokile panikubi'ki moko panani yako. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' atupeili loo ya bwoga, ila ya makakala, ya upendo no li'ngi'lya.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Kwa nyo, kanewibone oni kong'ondelya makowe ga Bwana witu au kwa mwanjaa nibile muutabilwe bu'kana na ywembe. Ila, ulu'mbane na nenga mutabu ya Injili kwa makakala gaupeyelwa na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Ywembe aatitukosopolya, na kutusawa tupange twabandu bake apeleteu. Aapangite nyo kwa kitumbu sa yendo yitu inannoga lili, ila kwo binia na kwa ngu'ngu' yake. Aatupei ngu'ngu' yo kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu Yesu, kubile balo umbilwa kwa dunia. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Na nambi'yambi' ngu'ngu' yo itanganikwe, kwo umukulilwa kwake nkosopoli witu Kilisitu Yesu ywaalabiye kiwo na kutulaya ukoto wangayomoka kwa ndi'la ya Abali Inannoga.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Kwa kitumbu sa Abali Inannoga yo nisaulilwe nibe namwaali, ntumilwe, na mwalimu. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Kwa kitumbu so nendaku'su'mbu'lwa, lakini niibonali oni kwa mwanjaa nintangite ywanimwu'bi'lile. Kai' nitangite panga endawesa kukili'ndi'la si'lu' saanikamukiye mpaka lisu'ba li'lu' lyo buyangana kwake. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Ugakamwe mayi'gano ga kakape gaugayu'wine gapange kili'be so yigilwa pamope na imani, na upendo mu Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Kwa makakala ga Loo Mpeleteu ywatama nkati yitu, ugali'ndi'le mayi'gano gano manogau gaukamukiyilwe.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Utangite panga bandu boti ba kunkoa wa Asia banilei, nkati yabe babile Figelo na Helimogene. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Bwana aabi'ki kiya alongo ba Onesiforo, kwa mwanjaa akokotyage isa kuniponwa moli na wala aibwenili oni kunibona nibile muutabilwe. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Paaikite Roma bai, aakasine kunipala mpaka paanibweni. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Na wenga ugatangite gambone gaanipangile akwo Efeso. Bwana ammi'ki kiya mulisu'ba lyake lyo buya.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Asikali mwu'bi'li'ka wa Kilisitu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Bai wamwana wangu', ube na makakala kwa ndi'la ya ngu'ngu' yatupata kwa Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Ugatole mayi'gano gaugayu'wine kasangu' nnu'ngi' ya bandu bambone, na wenga wayi'gane bandu bawau'bi'lya, li'nga baakombwe kwayi'gana bi'ngi' kai'. <verse eid="2TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Ulu'mbane na nenga mungu'su'mbu' kati asikali mwu'bi'li'ka wa Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Asikali mana abile kungondo, apalikwa abe kuutalu na makowe ga maisa ga kila lisu'ba, li'nga kumpulaisa mpi'ndo wake. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Mundu ywoywoti ywasindana ming'ando yo butuka lubi'lo, akombwali pata upo yo sinda mana akotwike koleya salya ya ming'ando yake. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Nni'mi ywakasana muuli'mi ngaywapalikwa pata mili'mbu' ya mauno gake. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Ugataunikiye ago ganigalongela, na Bwana aakupeya uweso wa kugatanga makowe galu' goti.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Unku'mbu'ki Yesu Kilisitu wa lubelekwo lwa Daudi ywayu'yilwe bu'ka kuuwi'li, kati mwaibaya Abali Inannoga yaniala. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Bu'kana na go nendaku'su'mbu'lwa ata baa muutabilwe kati nannau, lakini liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' litabilwali. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Kwa nyo nendakomeya goti kwa kitumbu sa babasaulilwe na Nnu'ngu' li'nga nabembe babe na ukosopoli waubile kwa Kilisitu Yesu, pamope na utukupu wangayomoka. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Mayi'gi'yo ga, ga kakape panga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">Mana twaawile pamope nakwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">twaalama nakwe kai'.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Mana twaakomeya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">twaatawala nakwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Mana twaankana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">naywembe aatukana.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Mana twau'bi'li'ka lili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">ywembe balo aau'bi'li'ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">kwa mwanjaa akombwali kwikana.<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpangakasi ywayi'ki'tilwe na Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Waku'mbu'ki'ye aumini makowe go na kwakwi'li'ka nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' panga bakotoke taukana bu'kana na mayi'gi'yo. Mitau ntu'pu' pwaila, ila yaalabiya babapi'kania. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Ukasane li'nga wilaye panga uyi'ki'tilwe na Nnu'ngu' kati mpangakasi ywangali kwibona oni, ywayi'gana kwa ukakape liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Wibi'ke kuutalu na mayi'gi'yo gabule ga mudunia, kwa mwanjaa ago gaapanga bandu babe kuutalu na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Mayi'gano gabe gendatema kati libanga lya matana. Nkati ya babayi'gana go, babile ki Himenayo na Fileto, <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>babailei kakape kababaya panga uyu'ki witu upite, no alabiya imani ya bandu bi'ngi'. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Lakini nsingi wa Nnu'ngu' wauyi'mi wisowiso uandikilwe kwa mayi'gi'yo aga, “Bwana aatangite bababile bake,” na, “Kila ywaibaya ywembe ywa Bwana, auleke ulau.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Muliku'ta kubile na yombo ya samani bai lili, ila na yangali samani, yi'ngi' itumika kwa makowe ga ngama, na yi'ngi' kwa kila lisu'ba. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Mundu mana aipeletiye kwa kugaleka malau goti, aapanga sombo sa ngama no saulilwa, kai' sendapwaika kwa lyengo lya Bwana no yi'ma wisowiso kwo panga makowe goti manogau. <verse eid="2TI 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Ugaleke maminyikio malau ga unsembe wako, ukoteye makowe ga aki, imani, upendo na amani pamope na bandu babankilikitya Bwana kwa myoyo mipeleteu. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Wibi'ke kuutalu na mitau ya kilogeloge yangali maana, kwa mwanjaa mitau iwesa leta bulwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Kai' ntumisi wa Bwana apalikwali abe munomo, ila abe nnogau kwa bandu boti, ywakombwa yi'gana na kwakomeya bandu. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>Apalikwa kwakwi'li'ka bandu babantaukya, ila kwa ukali'li. Pi'ngi' Nnu'ngu' aawesa kwayalya galambuka na kwitanga kweli. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Bu'kapo bawesa pata malango no ku'su'pu'ka mukitapa sa Ibilisi saayonjike kwo panga bapange mwapendi ywembe.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Masu'ba ga kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Nambi'yambi' utange panga, masu'ba ga kuundi'la kwalu'a baa na nsimu wa tabu. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Kwa mwanjaa bandu baalu'a kwipenda bene, baapenda mbanje, baalu'a kwilumba, babaa bene umbu'ku'su', balu'a baa atukani, bangali kwayu'wa abelei babe, bangali sukulu, bangali kumwisimu Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>bangali kwapenda ayabe, bangali penda awana, abai, bangali li'ngi'lya, akali', babakana manogau, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>asongi, kingayu'wa, babaipuna, babapenda muno maminyikio ga dunia kulikoni kumpenda Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Babonekana kati bandu bababi'ngi'ya gapala Nnu'ngu', lakini bagakana makakala gake. Kwa nyo utame kuutalu na bandu kati bo. <verse eid="2TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Nkati yabe babile babayingya mumayumba ga bandu na kwakonga alwawa alalo babatopilwe na masambi kabautilwa na maminyikio ga kila sampuli. <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>Alwawa bo bapala kwiyi'gana kila lisu'ba, lakini bakombwali kuutanga ukakape. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Bandu ba bautaukya ukakape kati mwabantauki Musa ki Yane na Yambre. Bandu bo malango gabe gatitindigana na imani yabe ipwaikali. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Lakini baayendelyali muno, kwa mwanjaa ulogeloge wabe waabonekana kwa bandu mpu'la, kati mwaubonekine ulogeloge wa balu' analu'me abi'li'.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagyo ga kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Ila wenga ukoleyite mayi'gano gangu', nnyendo wangu', binia kwangu', imani yangu', ukomeyi wangu', upendo wangu', na uli'ndi wangu'. <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>Utangite bandu mwabaniawiye na siki yaniipatike panaabile muilambo ya Antiokia, Ikonio na Lustila. Naatikomea goti, na Bwana Yesu nganikosopolya mu ago goti. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Kakape, boti babamwu'bi'lya Kilisitu Yesu no pala panga maisa gapala Nnu'ngu' baalu'a ku'su'mbu'lwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Lakini bandu alau na akongi baayendelya muno panga ulau, baalu'a kwakonga no kongelwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Lakini wenga uyendeli tama mu'lu' muukakape wauyi'ganilwe na kuuyi'ki'tya, kwa mwanjaa utangite wiyi'ganiye go bu'ka kwa nyai. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Bu'ka kuunangu'ta, ugatangite Maandiko Mapeleteu. Ago gakupanga utange panga ukosopoli upatikana kwa kumwu'bi'lya Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Maandiko Mapeleteu goti gaandikilwe kwa ulongosi wa Nnu'ngu' na gapwaika kwo yi'gana ukakape, kwi'li'ka no goloya mayi'gano, no longoya bandu batame mumaisa ga aki. <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>Maandiko gano gaapanga bandu ba Nnu'ngu' baibi'ke wiso no timya kwo panga manogau goti.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Nikulagya nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' na Kilisitu Yesu ywaalu'a kwaukumu akoti na awi'li, na ngaywaalu'a isa tawala abile nkulungwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>Uale liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu'. Utame wiso munsimu waupwaika na wangali pwaika. Ukalipi, ukwi'li'ke na wakangamaye bandu. Upange nyo ku'no kauyi'gana kwa ukomeyi woti. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Nikubakia panga ulu'a isa nsimu wa bandu kugakana mayi'gano ga kakape, kabapala gabapendi bene no sawa balimu baingi bo yi'gana gabagapendi kugapi'kania mumakutu gabe. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Baakana pi'kania ukakape no koleya u'mo ya ubu'su'. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Lakini wenga utame kwo li'ngi'lya mumakowe goti. Ukomeye ngu'su'mbu', uale Abali Inannoga, na upange kinannoga muutumisi wako woti.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Kwa mwanjaa nibi'ki'lwa wiso kati salaka, no yomoka kwangu' kuegelile. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Nitekasana mumasindano, mwanja niuyomolile na imani yangu' niikotike. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Na nambi'yambi' nipi'kanilya peyelwa taji ya aki. Bwana, nga akimu wa aki, aanipeya lisu'ba lyo buya kwake. Ayo napeyelwa nenga bai lili, ila na boti babamwu'bi'lya kwa kilu'lu' paabuya.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Ukasane isa kasangu' kiyu'ngu'ya. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Kwa mwanjaa Dema agapendi makowe ga padunia, nganileka no yenda ku Tesalonike. Kreske aayi'i Galatia, na Tito aayi'i Dalmatia. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Luka kisake ngaywaaigali nanenga pano. Pawisa ku'no ulongwane na Maluko kwa mwanjaa endapwaika kwa kuniyangatia mulyengo lya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Naantumike Tikiko yenda ku Efeso. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Pawalu'a isa wanipu'tu'li likoti lyanalilei Tiloa kwa Kalpo, na itabu, munomuno itabu yi'lu' ya maki'ngo.<verse eid="2TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Alekisanda pundi kipala aanipangi maakau gambone. Bwana alu'a kunni'pa bu'kana na mwapangite. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Wili'ndi'le bu'kana na ywembe, kwa mwanjaa aatigataukya muno mayi'gano gitu.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Panitumbwi kwikengya ntu'pu' mundu ywaaniyi'mile, boti baatinileka. Ninnu'ba Nnu'ngu' kaneabalangili likosa lyo! <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Lakini Bwana Yesu aabile na nenga. Aanipei makakala go ala Abali Inannoga li'nga bandu bangali Ayahudi wapate kwiyu'wa. Aanikosopoli mukiwo, kwa mwanjaa naai kati nibile pankano wa imba. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Bwana aalu'a yendelya kunikosopolya mumaakau goti na kunili'ndi'la mpaka panaaika muukulungwa wake wa kunani. Bwana Yesu akwi'yi'lwe milele na milele. Amina.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Salamu ya kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Wapei salamu ki Priska, Akula na alongo ba Onesiforo. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Elasito aaigali Kolinto, Tilofimo naanei Mileto kwa mwanjaa aai ntamwe.<verse eid="2TI 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Uyu'mbi'ti'ke isa kipepwe kibile balo. Eubulo, Pude, Linusi, Klaudia na aumini boti bakupei salamu.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Bwana Yesu abe na wenga. Ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' ibe namwe.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
